  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_mm",
      "name": {
        "en": "May's Badge",
        "zh": "梅证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "original",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator May has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for maintaining distance whilst conducting suppressive fire against the enemy.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Sniper Operator during field operations to exercise Marksman responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员梅擅长保持距离对敌人进行火力压制\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为狙击干员，行使速射手职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_mm",
      "name": {
        "en": "Novice Detective's Gift Bag",
        "zh": "新手侦探礼包",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "X",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_mm",
      "description": {
        "en": "On a Friday, the mean yet wealthy Mrs. Bride had the misfortune to pass away.\nAt the crack of dawn, the maid readied breakfast and tea as per the Dame's requirements, and after calling for the madam to wake, found that Mrs. Bride had ceased to breathe, with a shade of fright left in her turbidly dulled eyes.\n\nThe maid gave a shriek.\n\nThe constabulary came fast, and as police thronged before the villa, a young lady was invited in through the entrance, whose behavior drew the attention of all.\nThe young lady—mayhaps a girl—held a pipe in her left hand but never used it to smoke, seemingly only as a kind of qualification and self-assurance within her grasp. She gave a slight bow with her other hand holding out a magnifying glass before her, and then she took the measure of the villa step by step. All said and done, she lifted her head before the few people now stuck in the place.\nShe seemed somewhat nervous. Everyone could tell as much.\nThe girl took a long, deep breath and straightened her back, attempting to mask her vaguely perceptible timidity and fluster in front of all the suspects. She gripped her pipe tight, and gradually her nerves calmed.\nHer head was quite disheveled, her upwards-springing hair tied into two bunches, with red-rimmed spectacles and shining blue eyes behind them that gave a glimmering and lively gaze at the suspects before her.\n\n'Ladies and gentlemen.'\nFrom her breast pocket, the girl produced a pocket watch of fine craftsmanship, clearly exquisitely cared for throughout its years—of which it had plenty—and after checking the current time, she introduced herself thus, in an altogether too spry voice: 'Good morning, everyone. On request, I'll be the detective in charge of solving this case—'\n\nA detective!\nA faint murmur perturbed the crowd. She said she was a detective! Victoria certainly had no shortage of private detectives such as her, who took on all manner of commissions their clients were wary of entrusting to the police. Indeed, it was no unfamiliar profession.\nAnd yet...\nThis self-professed detective girl seemed simply too young!\n\n'Everyone! Hear me out, please!'\nThe tender detective surreptitiously gripped the items in her hands, then raised her voice. 'This may be the first case I've taken on—but—I ask you all to be at ease! I do have the approval of my grandfather and grandmother! I am a qualified detective!'\nShe did seem truly quite proud of the fact that her elders gave her their recognition, as her face which seemed altogether hesitant at first now gleamed bright with confidence.\nIt immediately gave her far more credible airs.\n\n'Thus, I ask you all to cooperate with my work!' said the young detective, puffing her chest out. And then with a bellow, 'I am!—this case's!—detective!'",
        "zh": "刻薄而富有的布莱德夫人于星期五不幸离世。\n女仆一早准备好了贵妇人早晨需要的茶与早餐，在想要呼唤女主人起床时，发觉布莱德夫人已没有声息，浑浊失光的双眼仍残留着惊恐的色彩。\n\n女仆发出了一声尖叫。\n\n警方很快赶来，而在大量警员涌入别墅之前，有一位被从正门请入的年轻女士，其行动引起了众人的注意。\n年轻的女士——或者说女孩——左手将一只烟斗拿在手中，却并不使用它吞云吐雾，仿佛只是将某种资格与自信握在掌心。她微微躬身，另一只手举起一柄放大镜悬在面前，一步一步在别墅中丈量，最后终于在被圈定的几人面前抬起头来。\n她好像有些紧张。大家都能看出来。\n女孩开始深深地吸气，挺直腰板，试图掩饰自己在诸位嫌疑人面前隐约可察的慌张与怯意，她紧紧地握住手中的烟斗，逐渐冷静下来。\n那头不太服贴、向上翘起的长发扎成两束，红色边框的眼镜之后，明亮的蓝色眼睛炯炯有神地注视着面前的嫌疑人。\n\n“女士们先生们。”\n女孩从怀中取出一只做工精良，足见厚重年代又一直被人精心保养的怀表，在查看过现在的时间后，用显得太过明快的声线自我介绍道：“各位早安。我是接到委托，负责解决本案的侦探——”\n\n一位侦探！\n人群略微骚动起来。她说自己是一位侦探！维多利亚确实有不少这样的私人侦探，负责解决一些主人不愿拜托警方的事务，人们对这个职业并不陌生。\n可是……\n可是这位自称侦探的女孩，她瞧起来实在是太年轻了！\n\n“诸位！请听我说！”\n过于年轻的侦探又不着痕迹地握了握手中的道具，提高了嗓音，“虽然这是我负责的第一个案件，但、请各位放心！我已经得到祖父祖母的认可，已经是个合格的侦探啦！”\n她看起来真是对自己获得祖辈认可一事颇为骄傲，那在刚抬起时还有些许犹豫的面庞上，现在已经闪烁起明亮的自信。\n这让她看起来顿时变得可靠多了。\n\n“所以请大家配合我的工作！”年轻的侦探挺起胸膛，大声说，“我是！本案的，侦探！”",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
